BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Candlelit Social with Irish Trad Music
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260228T183000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260228T213000
UID:38d042ac1870de39b53f6cbc@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Step into a Candlelit Social at the Mandala Café\, featuring 
 live Irish and Scottish music\, food and drinks. Our house band — Kavyam
 ani\, Chintamani\, Maitrishura\, Amalavira\, Ruth\, and Ian — will be pl
 aying a lively mix of traditional tunes\, with other folk musicians welcom
 e to bring their instruments and join the session. Enjoy the relaxed atmos
 phere with food and drinks available to purchase from the café canteen th
 roughout the evening.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/candlelit-social-with-ir
 ish-trad-music
